# dhamma-ontology: https://github.com/guoxiangng/dhamma-ontology
# Inferred: after OWL RL reasoning (+4266 triples) and rule R1 (+16).
# Sutta text from SuttaCentral (CC0): English by Bhikkhu Sujato, Pali from the Mahāsaṅgīti edition.
# Personal learning project; modelling unreviewed. See COVERAGE.md and DECISIONS.md.

