dho:p-sn46.53-15.4 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.53-15.4 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.53 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.53:15.4" ;
    dho:textEn "But mindfulness is always useful, I say.”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Satiñca khvāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sabbatthikaṁ vadāmī”ti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.53/en/sujato#sn46.53:15.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-2.3 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.56-2.3 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:2.3" ;
    dho:textEn "“There’s a time when the heart is overcome and mired in sensual desire, without truly knowing and seeing the escape from sensual desire that has arisen."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Yasmiṁ kho, rājakumāra, samaye kāmarāgapariyuṭṭhitena cetasā viharati kāmarāgaparetena, uppannassa ca kāmarāgassa nissaraṇaṁ yathābhūtaṁ na jānāti na passati—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:2.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-2.4 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.56-2.4 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:2.4" ;
    dho:textEn "This is a cause and reason for not knowing and not seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayampi kho, rājakumāra, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo aññāṇāya adassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:2.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-3.4 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.56-3.4 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:3.4" ;
    dho:textEn "doubt, without truly knowing and seeing the escape from doubt that has arisen."@en ;
    dho:textPi "vicikicchāpariyuṭṭhitena cetasā viharati vicikicchāparetena, uppannāya ca vicikicchāya nissaraṇaṁ yathābhūtaṁ na jānāti na passati—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:3.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-3.5 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.56-3.5 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:3.5" ;
    dho:textEn "This is a cause and reason for not knowing and not seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayampi kho, rājakumāra, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo aññāṇāya adassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:3.5"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-5.4 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.56-5.4 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:5.4" ;
    dho:textEn "They truly know and see with a mind that has developed the awakening factor of mindfulness."@en ;
    dho:textPi "So satisambojjhaṅgaṁ bhāvitena cittena yathābhūtaṁ jānāti passati—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:5.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-5.5 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.56-5.5 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:5.5" ;
    dho:textEn "This is a cause and reason for knowing and seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayampi kho, rājakumāra, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo ñāṇāya dassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:5.5"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-6.3 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.56-6.3 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:6.3" ;
    dho:textEn "They truly know and see with a mind that has developed the awakening factor of equanimity."@en ;
    dho:textPi "So upekkhāsambojjhaṅgaṁ bhāvitena cittena yathābhūtaṁ jānāti passati—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:6.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-6.4 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.56-6.4 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:6.4" ;
    dho:textEn "This is a cause and reason for knowing and seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayampi kho, rājakumāra, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo ñāṇāya dassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:6.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-1.2 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.57-1.2 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:1.2" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a skeleton is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aṭṭhikasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahapphalā hoti mahānisaṁsā."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:1.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-1.6 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.57-1.6 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:1.6" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how the perception of a skeleton, when developed and cultivated, is very fruitful and beneficial.”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Evaṁ bhāvitā kho, bhikkhave, aṭṭhikasaññā evaṁ bahulīkatā mahapphalā hoti mahānisaṁsā”ti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:1.6"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-3.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.57-3.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:3.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a skeleton is developed and cultivated it leads to great benefit."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aṭṭhikasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahato atthāya saṁvattati."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:3.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-4.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.57-4.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:4.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a skeleton is developed and cultivated it leads to great sanctuary from the yoke."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aṭṭhikasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahato yogakkhemāya saṁvattati."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:4.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-5.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.57-5.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:5.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a skeleton is developed and cultivated it leads to great inspiration."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aṭṭhikasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahato saṁvegāya saṁvattati."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:5.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-6.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.57-6.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:6.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a skeleton is developed and cultivated it leads to dwelling in great ease."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aṭṭhikasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahato phāsuvihārāya saṁvattati."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:6.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.58-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.58-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.58 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.58:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a worm-infested corpse is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Puḷavakasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.58/en/sujato#sn46.58:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.59-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.59-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.59 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.59:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a livid corpse is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Vinīlakasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.59/en/sujato#sn46.59:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.60-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.60-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.60 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.60:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a split open corpse is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Vicchiddakasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.60/en/sujato#sn46.60:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.61-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.61-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.61 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.61:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a bloated corpse is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Uddhumātakasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.61/en/sujato#sn46.61:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.62-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.62-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.62 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.62:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when love is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Mettā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.62/en/sujato#sn46.62:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.63-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.63-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.63 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.63:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when compassion is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Karuṇā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.63/en/sujato#sn46.63:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.64-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.64-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.64 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.64:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when rejoicing is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Muditā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.64/en/sujato#sn46.64:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.65-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.65-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.65 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.65:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when equanimity is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Upekkhā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.65/en/sujato#sn46.65:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.66-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.66-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.66 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.66:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when mindfulness of breathing is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Ānāpānassati, bhikkhave, bhāvitā …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.66/en/sujato#sn46.66:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.67-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.67-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.67 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.67:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of ugliness is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Asubhasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.67/en/sujato#sn46.67:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.68-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.68-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.68 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.68:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of death is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Maraṇasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.68/en/sujato#sn46.68:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.69-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.69-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.69 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.69:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of repulsiveness of food is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Āhāre paṭikūlasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.69/en/sujato#sn46.69:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.7-1.2 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.7-1.2 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.7 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.7:1.2" ;
    dho:textEn "In the same way, a mendicant who develops and cultivates the seven awakening factors slants, slopes, and inclines to extinguishment."@en ;
    dho:textPi "evameva kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu satta bojjhaṅge bhāvento satta bojjhaṅge bahulīkaronto nibbānaninno hoti nibbānapoṇo nibbānapabbhāro."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.7/en/sujato#sn46.7:1.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.7-2.4 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.7-2.4 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.7 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.7:2.4" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how a mendicant who develops and cultivates the seven awakening factors slants, slopes, and inclines to extinguishment.”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Evaṁ kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu satta bojjhaṅge bhāvento satta bojjhaṅge bahulīkaronto nibbānaninno hoti nibbānapoṇo nibbānapabbhāro”ti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.7/en/sujato#sn46.7:2.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.70-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.70-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.70 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.70:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of dissatisfaction with the whole world is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Sabbaloke anabhiratisaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.70/en/sujato#sn46.70:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.71-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.71-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.71 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.71:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of impermanence is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aniccasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.71/en/sujato#sn46.71:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.72-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.72-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.72 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.72:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of suffering in impermanence is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Anicce dukkhasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.72/en/sujato#sn46.72:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.73-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.73-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.73 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.73:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of not-self in suffering is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Dukkhe anattasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.73/en/sujato#sn46.73:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.74-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.74-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.74 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.74:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of giving up is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Pahānasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.74/en/sujato#sn46.74:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.75-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.75-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.75 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.75:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of dispassion is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Virāgasaññā, bhikkhave …pe…”"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.75/en/sujato#sn46.75:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.76-1.1 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.76-1.1 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.76 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.76:1.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of cessation is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Nirodhasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahapphalā hoti mahānisaṁsā."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.76/en/sujato#sn46.76:1.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.76-1.5 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Passage ;
    owl:sameAs dho:p-sn46.76-1.5 ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.76 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.76:1.5" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how, when the perception of cessation is developed and cultivated, it’s very fruitful and beneficial."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Evaṁ bhāvitā kho, bhikkhave, nirodhasaññā evaṁ bahulīkatā mahapphalā hoti mahānisaṁsāti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.76/en/sujato#sn46.76:1.5"^^xsd:anyURI .

