"Because it’s easy to settle a restless mind with these things."@en owl:sameAs "Because it’s easy to settle a restless mind with these things."@en .

"Because it’s easy to stimulate a sluggish mind with these things."@en owl:sameAs "Because it’s easy to stimulate a sluggish mind with these things."@en .

"Because it’s hard to settle a restless mind with these things."@en owl:sameAs "Because it’s hard to settle a restless mind with these things."@en .

"Because it’s hard to stimulate a sluggish mind with these things."@en owl:sameAs "Because it’s hard to stimulate a sluggish mind with these things."@en .

"But mindfulness is always useful, I say.”"@en owl:sameAs "But mindfulness is always useful, I say.”"@en .

